title = "Prosthetics"
description = "THE BEAT: late-mid, once the campaign has actually cost the player limbs. This node gives back a workforce they already lost, which lands very differently from one that hands them a new one — and it needs the lathe from metallurgy, because the tolerance that makes a gear makes a hand."
flavour = "Ash, leather and a machined joint. A man walks out of the ward and back onto the line."
